        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "I took a level 1 Spanish course from April to June 2019 and quickly learned the basics of Spanish structure.\n\nIf you're already good at French, learning Spanish will be like letting the wind fill your sails!\n\nMy teacher's name was Ricardo. He was an excellent teacher with a lot of charisma. That made learning easier!\n\nI just wrote this without a translator... (using a Spanish keyboard on my phone for word suggestions helped me learn more!) I hope I structured my impromptu Spanish sentence well! 😁",
